:"article","published":"2026-11-21T03:42:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzIwMTE1NjQxMQ%3D%3D:2247667818:1","title":"具身评测提速 15.8 倍：上交发布一站式评测工具 RoboScope Kit","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIwMTE1NjQxMQ==&mid=2247667818&idx=1&sn=0c2c42e84a8da5e2a55aaa28e6e4e994&chksm=97e96b00b0fb8960f7784c81bceca6a1300f8b1d754044139c4adda540d9afa0d9251311c1d5&scene=126&sessionid=1795488842#rd","description":"","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FP9MWBRYIGWic9nlRMkcTpaNRJr52SGRIOIQ9dIKoxpCcA9SREaDBM9df4pLPhEKH5wssqmR6hiahjuO4CWFl3QChFt5llCZvrpZKlKbxpuINc%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-20T14:36:50.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzIwMTE1NjQxMQ%3D%3D:2247667691:1","title":"狂烧300亿Token、从零手搓108款3D大作！上海创智学院推出首个超长程3D游戏Agent竞技场来了：代码跑通≠好玩，人类盲测胜率差出2.6倍","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIwMTE1NjQxMQ==&mid=2247667691&idx=1&sn=7188615ec981eedc5dc225bde2118ffb&chksm=97675a1d95db09a02a350a306ebb4f7009e80b93a9d3166eb8f71accd693e96bb13db68f77b3&scene=126&sessionid=1795488842#rd","description":"狂烧300亿Token手搓108款3D游戏！代码跑通≠好玩，真人盲测胜率差出2.6倍","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FP9MWBRYIGWibznhdHGicqNLWKltgoWTcd6BxRib9RiazmJ1rOj8mP3MfJgr0Mkjib4ISqcnqxJ4dI1hQaibdhPzMTnxV3eUSumJniaLjy1Ze8rsymk%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-19T13:27:27.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzIwMTE1NjQxMQ%3D%3D:2247667674:1","title":"TPAMI｜南方科大等提出DepthGS：首度推导深度误差理论上界，高斯表面重建与新视角合成双突破","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIwMTE1NjQxMQ==&mid=2247667674&idx=1&sn=0b3bc2f0952d63ce9918320eb75ed927&chksm=9753293cf977a581a0f14ec4560b43752444c902b6887d6c1f7afd68b7421f8760c379d0e83e&scene=126&sessionid=1795488842#rd","description":"误差上界破局高斯表面重建","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FP9MWBRYIGWibcu3m23ex5sXO7ZmGIUXYCXTUkyTR15PH53CbicY762A4dpfs0gJBlo9Xicgic1Uib5px2uBqxiasjr5nWiaJIkhwWchBr4GpXqcSOU%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-18T15:42:34.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzIwMTE1NjQxMQ%3D%3D:2247667654:1","title":"直接在像素上生成！PixVid将预训练Latent视","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIwMTE1NjQxMQ==&mid=2247667654&idx=1&sn=fdbb240aaa24e83d332ba68c591cd1ca&chksm=97fe6edebe6510dcc2f24f75af64462fd27716fbf754d3f2be95eeec2c5c77700bfb65fcbd14&scene=126&sessionid=1795488842#rd","description":"主流视频模型一直靠压缩画面省算力，现在这套玩法碰上高清和实时交互，开始露底了。\n\n分辨率一高，计算量暴涨；多帧压成一个特征，高速运动就容易变形；做交互还得攒够一组指令才动，延迟根本降不下来。\n\nRoblox 牵头的 PixVid 换了个思路：把现成模型直接拉回逐像素生成。它不用从头学，只改输入输出、重训一小块，64 张 B200 跑四千小时就收敛了。\n\n效果挺直观。画质追平甚至反超原模型；升到 960p，算力只涨 17%；高速运动编辑保留率冲到 98%，背景轮廓严丝合缝。交互延迟从近半秒压到 34 毫秒，按键下一帧就有反应，比原来快了 14 倍。\n\n代码还没开源，但路已经亮出来了——预训练模型能当先验用，没必要死守 VAE 那套压缩。","content":"<p>主流视频模型一直靠压缩画面省算力，现在这套玩法碰上高清和实时交互，开始露底了。<br /><br />分辨率一高，计算量暴涨；多帧压成一个特征，高速运动就容易变形；做交互还得攒够一组指令才动，延迟根本降不下来。<br /><br />Roblox 牵头的 PixVid 换了个思路：把现成模型直接拉回逐像素生成。它不用从头学，只改输入输出、重训一小块，64 张 B200 跑四千小时就收敛了。<br /><br />效果挺直观。画质追平甚至反超原模型；升到 960p，算力只涨 17%；高速运动编辑保留率冲到 98%，背景轮廓严丝合缝。交互延迟从近半秒压到 34 毫秒，按键下一帧就有反应，比原来快了 14 倍。<br /><br />代码还没开源，但路已经亮出来了——预训练模型能当先验用，没必要死守 VAE 那套压缩。</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FP9MWBRYIGW8t6ibr5JG56yUn9GaJibKR5UUic4d5n5tsyeak97gNhYZV3LTY1HGickd6nmjXerePt51BkM9mOW8niaUhTMnjtVyJ0ORjmGMich3jQ%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FP9MWBRYIGW8YpRIlxicag5micoJ8IA1icxJoGiaD1OibeVKibrcP4W8g6nQDTic4pt4mXYOPkpswcFDV27fZVkiaKDG5L8zYcYAoIWIuUbrbyRYAraU%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FP9MWBRYIGW8l6Nd3HrhBTIib7BCibQ2DAN46Mr4icgBKoS9XSfNSjMibUoGia8QsaLbgFFjlgEMrH9iaxIlUGvKTMcmORuiakrIia0xadjytsHWIMZ8%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmb